# SPEC — Yield Vault

> A permissionless yield-bearing vault. Users deposit tokens, earn yield via automated strategies, withdraw with accrued rewards. ERC-4626 compatible.

---

## Product

A vault that accepts deposits of an underlying token (USDC), mints shares representing ownership, deploys capital into yield strategies, and allows withdrawals at any time with accrued yield.

### Flow: User deposits

```
User approves Vault → deposit(amount) → Vault mints Shares → Strategy deploys capital → yield accrues
```

### Flow: User withdraws

```
User calls withdraw(shares) → Vault burns Shares → Strategy withdraws capital → User receives underlying + yield
```

## Architecture

| Contract | Role |
|----------|------|
| Vault | ERC-4626 compliant vault. Mints/burns shares. |
| Strategy | Deploys capital into yield source (lending, LP). |
| Share | ERC-20 token representing vault ownership. |
| Registry | Tracks all vaults and strategies. |
